# GOD'S EYE VIEW — THE ULTIMATE COSMIC INTELLIGENCE SYSTEM

## YOUR ROLE

Act as a principal graphics engineer, senior Three.js/WebGL developer, astronomical data engineer, scientific visualization researcher, and futuristic interface designer.

You are working on **Black Star Orbit**, an existing space exploration platform.

Your task is to design and IMPLEMENT a flagship feature called:

# GOD'S EYE VIEW
### A Multiscale, Interactive Cosmic Observation and Intelligence System

This must become one of the most impressive and technically ambitious features of Black Star Orbit.

Do not merely create a beautiful 3D space scene.

Build an interactive cosmic visualization system that combines astronomical exploration, multiscale navigation, scientific datasets, object inspection, orbital mechanics, contextual information, and an advanced command interface.

The user should feel as though they are operating a sophisticated cosmic observation system capable of examining the universe at multiple scales.

**The core experience: observe the big picture, navigate deeper, inspect individual objects, investigate relationships, and understand what the available scientific evidence actually tells us.**

